# Git-ignore driver binaries EXCEPT the ones we deliberately ship.
*.sys
!v1-binary-patch/applewirelessmouse.sys
!v1-binary-patch/installer/applewirelessmouse.sys
# UNSIGNED community driver binary. This is the one file in the community ZIP
# that a user cannot produce themselves without installing the WDK, so it has
# to be tracked. It carries NO signature and NO catalog: Setup-Community.cmd
# signs it locally with a code-signing certificate generated on the user's own
# PC. The maintainer's private key (thumbprint 16940C0F...) is never applied to
# the shipped copy and never enters this repo.
# Expected: 25600 bytes, SHA256 08E91E37AF3B7B9A56E793ADB876BA48FBD61DDFEE446C89A6A1751CABABD6AC
!v2-kmdf-driver/MagicMouseDriver-kmdf-204-scroll.sys

# Certificates EXCEPT release/
*.cer
*.pfx
*.p12
!v1-binary-patch/MagicMouseFix.cer
!v1-binary-patch/installer/MagicMouseFix.cer

